<title>USA: N.Y.C. says Merrill wins $875 mln of note sale.</title>
<headline>N.Y.C. says Merrill wins $875 mln of note sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York City on Wednesday said Merrill Lynch and Co Inc was awarded $875 million of the $1.6 billion of revenue anticipation notes that it sold, while five other firms submitted winning bids for the remainder.</p>
<p>&quot;They won $350 million of Series A and $525 million of Series B,&quot; said a city official, referring to Merrill Lynch.</p>
